{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21624","headline":"贻蜀五首 卢评事子蒙 · 元稹","name":"贻蜀五首 卢评事子蒙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲我殷勤卢子蒙，近来无复昔时同。\n懒成积疹推难动，禅尽狂心链到空。\n老爱早眠虚夜月，病妨杯酒负春风。\n唯公两弟闲相访，往往潸然一望公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}